49b9ee8c53421ea777f0dca8b294dc68e4150d38
Fix missing table grants for anon/authenticated (RLS != permissions)

schema.sql enabled RLS and wrote all 27 policies but never granted the
base table privileges those policies sit on top of - Postgres checks
plain GRANTs before RLS is even evaluated, so every request was
failing with 'permission denied for table X' regardless of how
correct the policies were. Adds the standard Supabase pattern (broad
GRANT to anon/authenticated + ALTER DEFAULT PRIVILEGES for future
tables, with RLS remaining the actual row-level boundary) to both
schema.sql and the repair script.

